{"title": "Improved Bardic Inspiration: Saving Throw", "pageid": 53395, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Improved_Bardic_Inspiration:_Saving_Throw", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Improved_Bardic_Inspiration_(disambiguation)\" title=\"Improved Bardic Inspiration (disambiguation)\">Improved Bardic Inspiration (disambiguation)</a>        </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Bardic_Roll.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/Bardic_Roll.webp/300px-Bardic_Roll.webp, /w/images/5/56/Bardic_Roll.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/Bardic_Roll.webp/300px-Bardic_Roll.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/56/Bardic_Roll.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Improved Bardic Inspiration: Saving Throw</b> is a passive feature that allows the user to improve the chance of success on their next saving throw when active.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Add a +1d12 bonus to your next <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Other ways to learn:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Granted to the user if they have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Improved_Bardic_Inspiration_(Condition)\" title=\"Improved Bardic Inspiration (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Improved Bardic Inspiration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d3/Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Improved_Bardic_Inspiration_(Condition)\" title=\"Improved Bardic Inspiration (Condition)\">Improved Bardic Inspiration</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714213255\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.042 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 890/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 6584/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2740/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 23/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand